<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>8.8.3: Factoring Quadratic Equations without a Linear Term</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m02217</md:content-id>
    <md:title>8.8.3: Factoring Quadratic Equations without a Linear Term</md:title>
    <md:uuid>51b0259e-b9d6-4c99-91b1-0185916145b5</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
    <section class="numbered-exercises" id="sect-00001">
      <title>Activity</title>
      <para id="para-00001">In questions 1 - 2, each row of the table contains a pair of equivalent
        expressions.</para>
      <exercise id="exer-00001">
        <problem id="prob-00001">
          <para id="para-00002">Convert the factored form expression to the standard form.</para>
          <para id="para-00003">If you get stuck, consider drawing a diagram.</para>
          <table class="unnumbered os-raise-midsizetable" id="table-00001">
            <tgroup cols="2">
            
  <tbody>
                <row>
                  <entry><emphasis> Factored form </emphasis>
                  </entry>
                  <entry><emphasis> Standard form </emphasis>
                  </entry>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <entry>
                    <m:math display="inline">
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                        <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                        <m:mn>10</m:mn>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                        <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                        <m:mn>10</m:mn>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:math>
                  </entry>
                  <entry> </entry>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <entry>
                    <m:math display="inline">
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                        <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                        <m:mn>1</m:mn>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                        <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                        <m:mn>1</m:mn>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:math>
                  </entry>
                  <entry> </entry>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <entry>
                    <m:math display="inline">
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                        <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                        <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                        <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                        <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:math>
                  </entry>
                  <entry> </entry>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <entry>
                    <m:math display="inline">
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                        <m:mi>c</m:mi>
                        <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                        <m:mfrac>
                          <m:mrow>
                            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                          </m:mrow>
                          <m:mrow>
                            <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                          </m:mrow>
                        </m:mfrac>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                        <m:mi>c</m:mi>
                        <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                        <m:mfrac>
                          <m:mrow>
                            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                          </m:mrow>
                          <m:mrow>
                            <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                          </m:mrow>
                        </m:mfrac>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:math>
                  </entry>
                  <entry> </entry>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <entry>
                    <m:math display="inline">
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                        <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                        <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                        <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                        <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:math>
                  </entry>
                  <entry> </entry>
                </row>
              </tbody>
            </tgroup>
          </table>
          <para id="para-00004">Write down your answers, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis>
            button to compare your work.</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00001">
          <para id="para-00005">Compare your answers:</para>
          <table class="unnumbered os-raise-midsizetable" id="table-00002">
            <tgroup cols="2">
            
  <tbody>
                <row>
                  <entry><emphasis> Factored form </emphasis>
                  </entry>
                  <entry><emphasis> Standard form </emphasis>
                  </entry>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <entry>
                    <m:math display="inline">
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                        <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                        <m:mn>10</m:mn>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                        <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                        <m:mn>10</m:mn>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:math>
                  </entry>
                  <entry>
                    <m:math display="inline">
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:msup>
                          <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                        </m:msup>
                        <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                        <m:mn>100</m:mn>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:math>
                  </entry>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <entry>
                    <m:math display="inline">
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                        <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                        <m:mn>1</m:mn>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                        <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                        <m:mn>1</m:mn>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:math>
                  </entry>
                  <entry>
                    <m:math display="inline">
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                        <m:msup>
                          <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                        </m:msup>
                        <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                        <m:mn>1</m:mn>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:math>
                  </entry>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <entry>
                    <m:math display="inline">
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                        <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                        <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                        <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                        <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:math>
                  </entry>
                  <entry>
                    <m:math display="inline">
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>16</m:mn>
                        <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                        <m:msup>
                          <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                        </m:msup>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:math>
                  </entry>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <entry>
                    <m:math display="inline">
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                        <m:mi>c</m:mi>
                        <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                        <m:mfrac>
                          <m:mrow>
                            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                          </m:mrow>
                          <m:mrow>
                            <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                          </m:mrow>
                        </m:mfrac>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                        <m:mi>c</m:mi>
                        <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                        <m:mfrac>
                          <m:mrow>
                            <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                          </m:mrow>
                          <m:mrow>
                            <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                          </m:mrow>
                        </m:mfrac>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:math>
                  </entry>
                  <entry>
                    <m:math display="inline">
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:msup>
                          <m:mi>c</m:mi>
                          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                        </m:msup>
                        <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                        <m:mfrac>
                          <m:mrow>
                            <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                          </m:mrow>
                          <m:mrow>
                            <m:mn>25</m:mn>
                          </m:mrow>
                        </m:mfrac>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:math>
                  </entry>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <entry>
                    <m:math display="inline">
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                        <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                        <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                        <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                        <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:math>
                  </entry>
                  <entry>
                    <m:math display="inline">
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:msup>
                          <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                        </m:msup>
                        <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                        <m:mn>10</m:mn>
                        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                        <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                        <m:mn>25</m:mn>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:math>
                  </entry>
                </row>
              </tbody>
            </tgroup>
          </table>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="exer-00002">
        <problem id="prob-00002">
          <para id="para-00006">Convert the standard form expression to the factored form.</para>
          <para id="para-00007">If you get stuck, consider drawing a diagram. (HINT: One of the
            expressions does not convert.)</para>
          <table class="unnumbered os-raise-midsizetable" id="table-00003">
            <tgroup cols="2">
            
  <tbody>
                <row>
                  <entry><emphasis> Factored form </emphasis>
                  </entry>
                  <entry><emphasis> Standard form </emphasis>
                  </entry>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <entry> </entry>
                  <entry>
                    <m:math display="inline">
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:msup>
                          <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                        </m:msup>
                        <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                        <m:mn>81</m:mn>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:math>
                  </entry>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <entry> </entry>
                  <entry>
                    <m:math display="inline">
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>49</m:mn>
                        <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                        <m:msup>
                          <m:mi>y</m:mi>
                          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                        </m:msup>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:math>
                  </entry>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <entry> </entry>
                  <entry>
                    <m:math display="inline">
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>9</m:mn>
                        <m:msup>
                          <m:mi>z</m:mi>
                          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                        </m:msup>
                        <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                        <m:mn>16</m:mn>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:math>
                  </entry>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <entry> </entry>
                  <entry>
                    <m:math display="inline">
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>25</m:mn>
                        <m:msup>
                          <m:mi>t</m:mi>
                          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                        </m:msup>
                        <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                        <m:mn>81</m:mn>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:math>
                  </entry>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <entry> </entry>
                  <entry>
                    <m:math display="inline">
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mfrac>
                          <m:mrow>
                            <m:mn>49</m:mn>
                          </m:mrow>
                          <m:mrow>
                            <m:mn>16</m:mn>
                          </m:mrow>
                        </m:mfrac>
                        <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                        <m:msup>
                          <m:mi>d</m:mi>
                          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                        </m:msup>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:math>
                  </entry>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <entry> </entry>
                  <entry>
                    <m:math display="inline">
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:msup>
                          <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                        </m:msup>
                        <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                        <m:mn>6</m:mn>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:math>
                  </entry>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <entry> </entry>
                  <entry>
                    <m:math display="inline">
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:msup>
                          <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                        </m:msup>
                        <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                        <m:mn>100</m:mn>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:math>
                  </entry>
                </row>
              </tbody>
            </tgroup>
          </table>
          <para id="para-00008">Write down your answers, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis>
            button to compare your work.</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00002">
          <para id="para-00009">Compare your answers:</para>
          <table class="unnumbered os-raise-midsizetable" id="table-00004">
            <tgroup cols="2">
            
  <tbody>
                <row>
                  <entry><emphasis> Factored form </emphasis>
                  </entry>
                  <entry><emphasis> Standard form </emphasis>
                  </entry>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <entry>
                    <m:math display="inline">
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                        <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                        <m:mn>9</m:mn>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                        <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                        <m:mn>9</m:mn>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:math>
                  </entry>
                  <entry>
                    <m:math display="inline">
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:msup>
                          <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                        </m:msup>
                        <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                        <m:mn>81</m:mn>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:math>
                  </entry>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <entry>
                    <m:math display="inline">
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                        <m:mn>7</m:mn>
                        <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                        <m:mi>y</m:mi>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                        <m:mn>7</m:mn>
                        <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                        <m:mi>y</m:mi>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:math>
                  </entry>
                  <entry>
                    <m:math display="inline">
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>49</m:mn>
                        <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                        <m:msup>
                          <m:mi>y</m:mi>
                          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                        </m:msup>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:math>
                  </entry>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <entry>
                    <m:math display="inline">
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                        <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                        <m:mi>z</m:mi>
                        <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                        <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                        <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                        <m:mi>z</m:mi>
                        <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                        <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:math>
                  </entry>
                  <entry>
                    <m:math display="inline">
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>9</m:mn>
                        <m:msup>
                          <m:mi>z</m:mi>
                          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                        </m:msup>
                        <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                        <m:mn>16</m:mn>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:math>
                  </entry>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <entry>
                    <m:math display="inline">
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                        <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                        <m:mi>t</m:mi>
                        <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                        <m:mn>9</m:mn>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                        <m:mn>5</m:mn>
                        <m:mi>t</m:mi>
                        <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                        <m:mn>9</m:mn>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:math>
                  </entry>
                  <entry>
                    <m:math display="inline">
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mn>25</m:mn>
                        <m:msup>
                          <m:mi>t</m:mi>
                          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                        </m:msup>
                        <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                        <m:mn>81</m:mn>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:math>
                  </entry>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <entry>
                    <m:math display="inline">
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                        <m:mfrac>
                          <m:mrow>
                            <m:mn>7</m:mn>
                          </m:mrow>
                          <m:mrow>
                            <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                          </m:mrow>
                        </m:mfrac>
                        <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                        <m:mi>d</m:mi>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                        <m:mfrac>
                          <m:mrow>
                            <m:mn>7</m:mn>
                          </m:mrow>
                          <m:mrow>
                            <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                          </m:mrow>
                        </m:mfrac>
                        <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                        <m:mi>d</m:mi>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:math>
                  </entry>
                  <entry>
                    <m:math display="inline">
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mfrac>
                          <m:mrow>
                            <m:mn>49</m:mn>
                          </m:mrow>
                          <m:mrow>
                            <m:mn>16</m:mn>
                          </m:mrow>
                        </m:mfrac>
                        <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                        <m:msup>
                          <m:mi>d</m:mi>
                          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                        </m:msup>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:math>
                  </entry>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <entry>
                    <m:math display="inline">
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                        <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                        <m:msqrt>
                          <m:mrow>
                            <m:mn>6</m:mn>
                          </m:mrow>
                        </m:msqrt>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                        <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                        <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                        <m:msqrt>
                          <m:mrow>
                            <m:mn>6</m:mn>
                          </m:mrow>
                        </m:msqrt>
                        <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:math>
                  </entry>
                  <entry>
                    <m:math display="inline">
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:msup>
                          <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                        </m:msup>
                        <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                        <m:mn>6</m:mn>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:math>
                  </entry>
                </row>
                <row>
                  <entry> prime </entry>
                  <entry>
                    <m:math display="inline">
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:msup>
                          <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                          <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                        </m:msup>
                        <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                        <m:mn>100</m:mn>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:math>
                  </entry>
                </row>
              </tbody>
            </tgroup>
          </table>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
    </section>
    <section id="sect-00002">
      <title>Video: Factoring Quadratic Equations Without a Linear Term</title>
      <para id="para-00010">Watch the following video to learn more about factoring a quadratic
        equation that is written in standard form and has no linear term.</para>
      <media alt="Placeholder for Alt Text">
        <iframe width="660" height="371.4"
          src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/843f647a9f05e9b8c05b506538b3f684950c1f1f" />
      </media>
    </section>
    <note class="self-check" id="note-00001">
      <exercise id="exer-00005">
        <problem id="prob-00005">
          <para id="para-00011"><link class="os-embed" url="#exercise/Alg1_8_8_3_SC" /></para>
        </problem>
      </exercise>

    </note>
    <section id="sect-00003">
      <title>Additional Resources</title>
      <section id="sect-00004">
        <title>Factoring Quadratic Equations Without a Linear Term</title>
        <para id="para-00012">We can use what we have learned in the previous lesson to write
          quadratic equations of a special form into factored form.</para>
        <para id="para-00013">Particularly, we can rewrite:</para>
        <para id="para-00014"><m:math display="inline">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:msup>
                <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:msup>
              <m:mi>−</m:mi>
              <m:msup>
                <m:mi>c</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:msup>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> into <m:math
            display="inline">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
              <m:mi>x</m:mi>
              <m:mo>+</m:mo>
              <m:mi>c</m:mi>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
              <m:mi>x</m:mi>
              <m:mi>−</m:mi>
              <m:mi>c</m:mi>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>.</para>
        <para id="para-00015">Let's look at an example.</para>
        <para id="para-00016"><emphasis>Example 1</emphasis></para>
        <para id="para-00017">Write <m:math display="inline">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:msup>
                <m:mi>v</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:msup>
              <m:mi>−</m:mi>
              <m:mn>36</m:mn>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> in factored form.</para>
        <para id="para-00018">We know that the form we are looking for is <m:math display="inline">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
              <m:mi>v</m:mi>
              <m:mspace width="0.278em" />
              <m:mi>−</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> __ <m:math display="inline">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
              <m:mi>v</m:mi>
              <m:mspace width="0.278em" />
              <m:mo>+</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> __ <m:math display="inline">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>.</para>
        <para id="para-00019">Since we know the square <term class="glossary-tooltip"
            id="term-00001">root</term> of <m:math display="inline">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:msup>
                <m:mi>v</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:msup>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> is <m:math
            display="inline">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>v</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> and the square root of 36 is 6,
          the factored form is <m:math display="inline">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
              <m:mi>v</m:mi>
              <m:mi>−</m:mi>
              <m:mn>6</m:mn>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
              <m:mi>v</m:mi>
              <m:mo>+</m:mo>
              <m:mn>6</m:mn>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>.</para>
        <para id="para-00020">We can multiply to check our work.</para>
        <para id="para-00021"><m:math display="inline">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
              <m:mi>v</m:mi>
              <m:mi>−</m:mi>
              <m:mn>6</m:mn>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
              <m:mi>v</m:mi>
              <m:mo>+</m:mo>
              <m:mn>6</m:mn>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math></para>
        <para id="para-00033"><m:math display="inline">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mtable>
                <m:mtr>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="left">
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                      <m:msup>
                        <m:mi>v</m:mi>
                        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                      </m:msup>
                      <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                      <m:mn>6</m:mn>
                      <m:mi>v</m:mi>
                      <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                      <m:mn>6</m:mn>
                      <m:mi>v</m:mi>
                      <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                      <m:mn>36</m:mn>
                      <m:mspace linebreak="newline" />
                      <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                      <m:msup>
                        <m:mi>v</m:mi>
                        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                      </m:msup>
                      <m:mo>−</m:mo>
                      <m:mn>36</m:mn>
                      <m:mspace width="0.278em" />
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mi style="color:red">✓</m:mi>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:mrow>
                  </m:mtd>
                </m:mtr>
              </m:mtable>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math></para>
        <para id="para-00022">The process is similar when there is a coefficient on the squared
          term.</para>
        <para id="para-00023"><m:math display="inline">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:msup>
                <m:mi>a</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:msup>
              <m:msup>
                <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:msup>
              <m:mi>−</m:mi>
              <m:msup>
                <m:mi>c</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:msup>
              <m:mspace width="0.278em" />
              <m:mspace width="0.278em" />
              <m:mspace width="0.278em" />
              <m:mspace width="0.278em" />
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> factors into <m:math
            display="inline">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mspace width="0.278em" />
              <m:mspace width="0.278em" />
              <m:mspace width="0.278em" />
              <m:mspace width="0.278em" />
              <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
              <m:mi>a</m:mi>
              <m:mi>x</m:mi>
              <m:mo>+</m:mo>
              <m:mi>c</m:mi>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
              <m:mi>a</m:mi>
              <m:mi>x</m:mi>
              <m:mi>−</m:mi>
              <m:mi>c</m:mi>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math></para>
        <para id="para-00024">Let's look at another example to understand the process.</para>
        <para id="para-00025"><emphasis>Example 2</emphasis></para>
        <para id="para-00026">Write <m:math display="inline">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>16</m:mn>
              <m:msup>
                <m:mi>m</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:msup>
              <m:mi>−</m:mi>
              <m:mn>81</m:mn>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> in factored form.</para>
        <para id="para-00027">The form we are looking for now is ( __ − __ )( __ + __ ).</para>
        <para id="para-00028">Taking the square root of the first term gives us <m:math
            display="inline">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>4</m:mn>
              <m:mi>m</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>.</para>
        <para id="para-00029">So, we have <m:math display="inline">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
              <m:mn>4</m:mn>
              <m:mi>m</m:mi>
              <m:mspace width="0.278em" />
              <m:mi>−</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> __ <m:math display="inline">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
              <m:mn>4</m:mn>
              <m:mi>m</m:mi>
              <m:mspace width="0.278em" />
              <m:mo>+</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> __ <m:math display="inline">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>.</para>
        <para id="para-00030">Now, we are in the same place as in the previous example. The square
          root of 81 is 9.</para>
        <para id="para-00031">So, the factored form is <m:math display="inline">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
              <m:mn>4</m:mn>
              <m:mi>m</m:mi>
              <m:mi>−</m:mi>
              <m:mn>9</m:mn>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
              <m:mn>4</m:mn>
              <m:mi>m</m:mi>
              <m:mo>+</m:mo>
              <m:mn>9</m:mn>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math>.</para>
        <para id="para-00032">Again, we can multiply to check.</para>
        <para id="para-00038"><m:math display="inline">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
              <m:mn>4</m:mn>
              <m:mi>m</m:mi>
              <m:mi>−</m:mi>
              <m:mn>9</m:mn>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
              <m:mn>4</m:mn>
              <m:mi>m</m:mi>
              <m:mo>+</m:mo>
              <m:mn>9</m:mn>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math></para>
        <para id="para-00040"><m:math display="inline">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mtable>
                <m:mtr>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="right" />
                  <m:mtd columnalign="center" />
                  <m:mtd columnalign="left">
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                      <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                      <m:msup>
                        <m:mi>m</m:mi>
                        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                      </m:msup>
                      <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                      <m:mn>36</m:mn>
                      <m:mi>m</m:mi>
                      <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                      <m:mn>36</m:mn>
                      <m:mi>m</m:mi>
                      <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                      <m:mn>81</m:mn>
                      <m:mspace linebreak="newline" />
                      <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                      <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                      <m:msup>
                        <m:mi>m</m:mi>
                        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                      </m:msup>
                      <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                      <m:mn>81</m:mn>
                      <m:mspace width="0.278em" />
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mi style="color:red">✓</m:mi>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:mrow>
                  </m:mtd>
                </m:mtr>
              </m:mtable>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math></para>
        <para id="para-00034"><emphasis>Example 3</emphasis></para>
        <para id="para-00035">As we see in the activity, where the variable is located is not
          important as long as the quadratic binomial is still the difference of two squares.</para>
        <para id="para-00036">Write <m:math display="inline">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>64</m:mn>
              <m:mi>−</m:mi>
              <m:mn>9</m:mn>
              <m:msup>
                <m:mi>b</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:msup>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> in
          factored form.</para>
        <para id="para-00037">We use the same concept to find the factored form.</para>
        <para id="para-00045"><m:math>
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mn>64</m:mn>
              <m:mi>−</m:mi>
              <m:mn>9</m:mn>
              <m:msup>
                <m:mi>b</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:msup>
              <m:mo>=</m:mo>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
              <m:mn>8</m:mn>
              <m:mi>−</m:mi>
              <m:mn>3</m:mn>
              <m:mi>b</m:mi>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
              <m:mn>8</m:mn>
              <m:mo>+</m:mo>
              <m:mn>3</m:mn>
              <m:mi>b</m:mi>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math></para>
        <para id="para-00039">We can multiply to check.</para>
        <para id="para-00049"><m:math display="inline">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
              <m:mn>8</m:mn>
              <m:mi>−</m:mi>
              <m:mn>3</m:mn>
              <m:mi>b</m:mi>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
              <m:mn>8</m:mn>
              <m:mo>+</m:mo>
              <m:mn>3</m:mn>
              <m:mi>b</m:mi>
              <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math></para>
        <para id="para-00050"><m:math display="inline">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mtable>
                <m:mtr>
                  <m:mtd columnalign="right" />
                  <m:mtd columnalign="center" />
                  <m:mtd columnalign="left">
                    <m:mrow>
                      <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                      <m:mn>64</m:mn>
                      <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                      <m:mn>24</m:mn>
                      <m:mi>b</m:mi>
                      <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                      <m:mn>24</m:mn>
                      <m:mi>b</m:mi>
                      <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                      <m:mn>9</m:mn>
                      <m:msup>
                        <m:mi>b</m:mi>
                        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                      </m:msup>
                      <m:mspace linebreak="newline" />
                      <m:mo>=</m:mo>
                      <m:mn>64</m:mn>
                      <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                      <m:mn>9</m:mn>
                      <m:msup>
                        <m:mi>b</m:mi>
                        <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                      </m:msup>
                      <m:mspace width="0.278em" />
                      <m:mrow>
                        <m:mi style="color:red">✓</m:mi>
                      </m:mrow>
                    </m:mrow>
                  </m:mtd>
                </m:mtr>
              </m:mtable>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math></para>
        <para id="para-00041">Remember that any expression of the form <m:math display="inline">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:msup>
                <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:msup>
              <m:mo>+</m:mo>
              <m:mi>c</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> or <m:math display="inline">
            <m:mrow>
              <m:mi>a</m:mi>
              <m:msup>
                <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:msup>
              <m:mo>+</m:mo>
              <m:mi>c</m:mi>
            </m:mrow>
          </m:math> does not have a factored form!</para>
        <list id="list-00001">
          <item>For <m:math display="inline">
              <m:mrow>
                <m:msup>
                  <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:msup>
                <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                <m:mi>c</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math>, the <m:math
              display="inline">
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>c</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math> is not squared, and the
            terms are not being subtracted.</item>
          <item>For <m:math display="inline">
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>a</m:mi>
                <m:msup>
                  <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:msup>
                <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                <m:mi>c</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math>, neither the <m:math
              display="inline">
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>a</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math> nor the <m:math
              display="inline">
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>c</m:mi>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:math> is a perfect square, and
            the terms are not being subtracted.</item>
        </list>
        <note class="try numbered-exercises" id="note-00002">
          <title>Try It: Factoring Quadratic Equations Without a Linear Term</title>
      <exercise
            id="exer-00003">
            <problem id="prob-00003">
              <para id="para-00042">Write <m:math display="inline">
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:msup>
                      <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                      <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                    </m:msup>
                    <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                    <m:mn>4</m:mn>
                  </m:mrow>
                </m:math> in factored
          form.</para>
              <para id="para-00043">Write down your answers, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis>
          button to compare your work.</para>
            </problem>
            <solution id="sol-00003">
              <para id="para-00044">Here is how to write the expressions in factored form.</para>
              <para id="para-00051"><m:math>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                    <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                    <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                    <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                    <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                    <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                    <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                  </m:mrow>
                </m:math></para>
            </solution>
          </exercise>
      <exercise
            id="exer-00004">
            <problem id="prob-00004">
              <para id="para-00046">Write <m:math display="inline">
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mn>100</m:mn>
                    <m:msup>
                      <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                      <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                    </m:msup>
                    <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                    <m:mn>121</m:mn>
                  </m:mrow>
                </m:math> in factored
          form.</para>
              <para id="para-00047">Write down your answers, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis>
          button to compare your work.</para>
            </problem>
            <solution id="sol-00004">
              <para id="para-00048">Here is how to write the expressions in factored form.</para>
              <para id="para-00052"><m:math>
                  <m:mrow>
                    <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                    <m:mn>10</m:mn>
                    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                    <m:mi>−</m:mi>
                    <m:mn>11</m:mn>
                    <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                    <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                    <m:mn>10</m:mn>
                    <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                    <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                    <m:mn>11</m:mn>
                    <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                  </m:mrow>
                </m:math></para>
            </solution>
          </exercise>
        </note>
      </section>
    </section>
  </content>
</document>